      "writtenOn": "2026-08-18T12:15:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Addressed in PS5: both callers now share rdma_mlx5_build_tso(), including the regular-SEND fallback when pkt_sz is smaller than hdr_sz; the helper returns status, buffer index, WQEBB count and last control segment.",
      "parentUuid": "ee46f24f_690ca2de",
      "revId": "e426b6079f2b46961be88d7a26fa4a8077894321",
      "serverId": "6d2eb258-4fe2-443e-8a38-ca81da23d4c2"
